# N4 (LMX_semantics.ru.md #method-parts; Step 1 K2): A() declares an inert empty Structure with no procedure. As the
# code of call: A D it requires no place, so any Structure is its data, untouched; the walker runs it through the
# contractless EXEC, which validates the selected code, not the data. Entry 7.
A()
D:
    int: x 5
end: D
call: A D
int: r 81
if: D\x = 5
    r: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: r; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
